Of course, here are the two most trending attractions in Ho Chi Minh City:

**1. Small-Group Tour of the Cu Chi Tunnels**
This tour focuses on the historic Cu Chi Tunnels, an extensive network of underground tunnels used during the Vietnam War. You'll learn about the history of the tunnels, how they were used, and what life was like for the soldiers who lived in them. You'll also have the opportunity to crawl through a section of the tunnels and taste cassava, a staple food during the war.

**2. Full-day Guided Mekong Delta & Củ Chi Tunnels Tour**
This comprehensive tour combines a visit to the Cu Chi Tunnels with an exploration of the Mekong Delta. In addition to the tunnel experience, you'll get to see the lush landscapes of the delta, visit a coconut candy factory, and take a boat trip on the Mekong River.

